{
  "info": {
    "name": "Lipa Cart API - Complete",
    "description": "Complete Lipa Cart Strapi backend API with all endpoints.\n\n**Base URLs:**\n- Production: https://lipa-cart-strapi-production.up.railway.app\n- Local Dev: http://localhost:1337\n\n## Authentication\n- Most GET endpoints are **public** (no auth required)\n- POST, PUT, DELETE require **JWT Bearer token**\n\n## Roles & Permissions\n- **Customer**: Browse catalog, manage own orders/addresses\n- **Shopper**: Update assigned orders, manage items\n- **Rider**: Manage deliveries\n- **Admin**: Full access\n\n## Query Parameters\n- `populate=*` — Include all relations\n- `filters[field][$eq]=value` — Exact match\n- `filters[field][$contains]=value` — Contains text\n- `sort=field:asc` or `field:desc` — Sort\n- `pagination[page]=1&pagination[pageSize]=25` — Paginate",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:1337",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "productionUrl",
      "value": "https://lipa-cart-strapi-production.up.railway.app",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bearerToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{bearerToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "User authentication and registration endpoints",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/local",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "local"]
            },
            "description": "Login with email/username and password. Returns JWT token.\n\n**Response**: { jwt, user: { id, username, email, role } }"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"newuser\",\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/local/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "local", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new user. Returns JWT token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Get currently authenticated user details. Requires bearer token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "Custom user profiles with phone, name, and user type",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users?populate=*",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users"],
              "query": [
                {"key": "populate", "value": "*"},
                {"key": "filters[user_type][$eq]", "value": "customer", "disabled": true},
                {"key": "filters[phone][$contains]", "value": "", "disabled": true}
              ]
            },
            "description": "List user profiles.\n\n**Fields**: phone, email, name, profile_photo, user_type, is_active\n**Relations**: customer, shopper, rider, admin"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/:id?populate=*",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", ":id"],
              "variable": [{"key": "id", "value": "1"}],
              "query": [{"key": "populate", "value": "*"}]
            },
            "description": "Get a single user profile by ID."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"phone\": \"+256700000001\",\n    \"email\": \"customer@example.com\",\n    \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n    \"user_type\": \"customer\",\n    \"is_active\": true\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new user profile.\n\n**user_type**: customer, shopper, rider, admin"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"name\": \"Jane Doe Updated\",\n    \"email\": \"newemail@example.com\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", ":id"],
              "variable": [{"key": "id", "value": "1"}]
            },
            "description": "Update a user profile."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
